WEBVTT

00:16.410 --> 00:20.020
<b>Your eyes that look far off
into the distance</b>

00:20.020 --> 00:23.650
<b>They're listening to the voice
within your heart</b>

00:23.650 --> 00:27.650
<b>Embracing a still blue moon</b>

00:31.030 --> 00:34.560
<b>Your strength to keep on running</b>

00:34.560 --> 00:38.230
<b>Will open another new door for you</b>

00:38.230 --> 00:42.190
<b>Illuminate the night that
dawns too soon</b>

00:45.540 --> 00:52.780
<b>Even alone, I want to keep on
believing in you</b>

00:52.780 --> 01:00.060
<b>It's in such a moment that
this world will begin to stir</b>

01:00.060 --> 01:03.730
<b>What should we be searching for?</b>

01:03.730 --> 01:07.330
<b>Send out your soul</b>

01:07.330 --> 01:14.600
<b>We'll meet here again someday,
if that's the truth</b>

01:14.600 --> 01:18.240
<b>What should we fix our gaze upon?</b>

01:18.240 --> 01:24.980
<b>The reality that I reached out
and grabbed with my hand</b>

01:24.980 --> 01:28.750
<b>Let it go, let's believe in it</b>

01:37.530 --> 01:41.500
<b>A dark era that shakes
the very earth...</b>

01:41.500 --> 01:45.200
<b>Demonic beings appear
out of the darkness.</b>

01:45.200 --> 01:47.400
<b>People run in search of escape,</b>

01:47.400 --> 01:50.570
<b>and the Earth becomes
the very picture of Hell.</b>

01:50.570 --> 01:55.640
<b>Then a single shaft of light
shines in from the East,</b>

01:55.640 --> 01:57.480
<b>and a young man appears.</b>

01:57.480 --> 02:01.580
<b>He wears a scripture draped about
his shoulders as a vestment</b>

02:01.580 --> 02:04.350
<b>and has the crimson chakra
upon his brow.</b>

02:04.350 --> 02:10.480
<b>With three followers at his side,
he disperses the demonic.</b>

02:11.530 --> 02:15.050
<b>Peace returns to the land once again.</b>

02:20.340 --> 02:25.440
<b>It's an ancient legend passed down
for generations in this village.</b>

02:25.440 --> 02:28.710
<b>So, Elder, who is this?</b>

02:28.710 --> 02:32.110
<b>That man is Priest Sanzo.</b>

02:33.320 --> 02:34.820
<b>Sanzo?</b>

02:34.820 --> 02:39.250
<b>A long time ago, there were bad
demons who plagued the villagers.</b>

02:39.250 --> 02:43.820
<b>He's the great priest who read from
the scriptures and defeated them.</b>

02:46.130 --> 02:51.400
<b>Say, Elder, do you think he'll
come to this village again?</b>

02:51.400 --> 02:57.430
<b>Yes, if this village is ever in danger,
he's sure to come again.</b>

03:01.440 --> 03:04.850
<b>A village! We're finally here!</b>

03:04.850 --> 03:07.210
<b>All right, that's our next village then.</b>

03:18.760 --> 03:21.630
<b>Hey, Sanzo, I'm hungry!</b>

03:21.630 --> 03:24.100
<b>Don't you have anything
else you can say?</b>

03:24.100 --> 03:26.700
<b>Day in and day out, it's,
"I'm hungry, I'm hungry."</b>

03:26.700 --> 03:29.840
<b>That's called being a one-trick monkey.</b>

03:29.840 --> 03:32.270
<b>What the hell did you say,
you pervy water sprite?!</b>

03:32.270 --> 03:35.810
<b>You've got a brain like a grotto too!</b>

03:35.810 --> 03:38.910
<b>Quit using weird words you don't
even know the meaning of,</b>

03:38.910 --> 03:40.520
<b>you stupid monkey!</b>

03:40.520 --> 03:43.390
<b>Oh, shut up! I do too know
what it means!</b>

03:43.390 --> 03:47.450
<b>Oh, really? Then let's hear it.
Come on, right here, right now.</b>

03:50.090 --> 03:51.520
<b>Come on, come on.</b>

03:52.130 --> 03:53.960
<b>Sanzo...</b>

03:53.960 --> 03:56.030
<b>Shut up. I don't wanna hear it.</b>

03:56.030 --> 03:59.770
<b>So it WAS you who taught it to him,
you stinking monk!</b>

03:59.770 --> 04:01.340
<b>What're you talking about?</b>

04:01.340 --> 04:03.640
<b>You're a monk, and you're trying
to weasel your way out of this?!</b>

04:03.640 --> 04:05.240
<b>I don't know what you're talking about!</b>

04:05.240 --> 04:06.510
<b>But Sanzo, before you said...</b>

04:06.510 --> 04:06.740
<b>Oh, everyone, it's a village! Why don't
you stop already and...
But Sanzo, before you said...</b>

04:06.740 --> 04:09.640
<b>Oh, everyone, it's a village! Why don't
you stop already and...</b>

04:10.380 --> 04:12.080
<b>Sanzo, this is your fault!</b>

04:12.080 --> 04:14.170
<b>Can't you quit fighting for once?!</b>

04:18.850 --> 04:20.320
<b>Yay!</b>

04:21.360 --> 04:24.760
<b>Food, food! It's food!</b>

04:24.760 --> 04:26.290
<b>Dinner, dinner, dinner!</b>

04:26.290 --> 04:29.630
<b>From the looks of this, we should be
able to find an inn and a meal.
Gonna eat, gonna eat.
I'm gonna eat lots.</b>

04:29.630 --> 04:30.230
<b>I'll eat anything! Dinner, dinner, dinner!</b>

04:30.230 --> 04:33.130
<b>The only other question is how many
pretty girls are around.
I'll eat anything! Dinner, dinner, dinner!</b>

04:33.970 --> 04:35.440
<b>Wait!</b>

04:37.270 --> 04:40.940
<b>Ow! I'm sorry. We were playing tag.</b>

04:42.180 --> 04:45.310
<b>Are you all right? You shouldn't
run in the streets.</b>

04:46.580 --> 04:50.090
<b>Dressed in white, a scripture draped
around his shoulders...</b>

04:50.090 --> 04:53.420
<b>And clear, blue eyes...</b>

04:54.390 --> 04:57.150
<b>You're Priest Sanzo!</b>

05:11.210 --> 05:14.310
<b>Now, please be quiet,
please be quiet.</b>

05:14.310 --> 05:19.380
<b>Priest Sanzo, you honor us by
visiting this tiny village.</b>

05:19.380 --> 05:23.180
<b>Excuse me, but what's this all about?</b>

05:23.180 --> 05:28.780
<b>Oh, of course. I must relate
to you how it all began.</b>

05:30.760 --> 05:35.300
<b>A long time ago, this village was
once saved by Priest Sanzo.</b>

05:35.300 --> 05:38.790
<b>This happened roughly
four hundred years ago.</b>

05:39.730 --> 05:42.900
<b>Sanzo, you came here
that long time ago?</b>

05:42.900 --> 05:44.640
<b>Like hell I could've.</b>

05:44.640 --> 05:47.340
<b>The name of Sanzo has been passed
down generation after generation</b>

05:47.340 --> 05:49.610
<b>to the guardian of the Scripture.</b>

05:49.610 --> 05:52.950
<b>We weren't able to thank Priest
Sanzo properly back then,</b>

05:52.950 --> 05:56.320
<b>so we decided when he
came to our village again,</b>

05:56.320 --> 06:00.910
<b>we'd do everything we could
to welcome him.</b>

06:01.920 --> 06:05.230
<b>I see. I understand the situation.</b>

06:05.230 --> 06:06.160
<b>Then...</b>

06:06.160 --> 06:06.730
<b>No, I appreciate your sentiments, but...
Then...</b>

06:06.730 --> 06:08.250
<b>No, I appreciate your sentiments, but...</b>

06:09.130 --> 06:12.030
<b>Sanzo says he's very grateful
for your welcome.</b>

06:12.030 --> 06:14.540
<b>Sanzo says he's hungry!</b>

06:14.540 --> 06:16.000
<b>I'll kill them!</b>

06:17.040 --> 06:18.910
<b>Yes, Sir, right away then...</b>

06:18.910 --> 06:20.510
<b>Hold it!</b>

06:20.510 --> 06:22.140
<b>Is there something?</b>

06:22.140 --> 06:24.950
<b>Sanzo says he wants to eat meat.</b>

06:24.950 --> 06:28.380
<b>Sanzo says to have pretty women
wait on us.</b>

06:28.380 --> 06:32.120
<b>Oh, he also seems to be asking
for a little alcohol.</b>

06:32.120 --> 06:33.860
<b>I'll really kill them!</b>

06:33.860 --> 06:36.760
<b>Yes, Sir, I'll have t all
prepared right away.</b>

06:42.700 --> 06:44.670
<b>Sheesh...</b>

06:44.670 --> 06:47.170
<b>What're you so mad about, Sanzo?</b>

06:47.170 --> 06:50.310
<b>That's right. They said they're
going to treat us,</b>

06:50.310 --> 06:52.400
<b>so all we have to do is
gratefully accept it.</b>

06:53.710 --> 06:55.540
<b>Damn pair of one-track minded idiots.</b>

06:55.540 --> 06:57.670
<b>What I'm worried about is
what comes after that.</b>

06:58.380 --> 07:00.120
<b>Meaning?</b>

07:00.120 --> 07:01.750
<b>People like them always come nagging</b>

07:01.750 --> 07:04.050
<b>for me to stay or give them lectures</b>

07:04.050 --> 07:08.490
<b>just for having given us a meal
and a night's rest.</b>

07:10.230 --> 07:12.330
<b>That might be unfortunate for you,</b>

07:12.330 --> 07:14.390
<b>but it has nothing to do
with these two.</b>

07:15.060 --> 07:18.170
<b>We hear tell that you guys</b>

07:18.170 --> 07:21.900
<b>are the insolent fools pretending
to be the Sanzo Party.</b>

07:21.900 --> 07:25.640
<b>Now that the real Sanzo Party
happened to stop by here,</b>

07:25.640 --> 07:28.010
<b>you won't get away with this.</b>

07:28.010 --> 07:30.440
<b>Damn reprehensible miscreants!</b>

07:34.420 --> 07:36.280
<b>Don't laugh, you insolent fools!</b>

07:36.280 --> 07:38.850
<b>Who do you think this is?!</b>

07:38.850 --> 07:42.720
<b>He's none other than the
legendary Priest Sanzo!</b>

07:45.330 --> 07:49.230
<b>Can't breathe! You trying to make me
laugh myself to death?!</b>

07:49.230 --> 07:50.820
<b>He called us insolent fools!</b>

07:52.130 --> 07:56.500
<b>That Gojyo's... That Gojyo's...
He's hilarious!</b>

07:56.500 --> 07:59.940
<b>Now, now, don't be rude
to the cos-players.</b>

08:02.680 --> 08:05.340
<b>He asked who we think that is,
but you know...</b>

08:08.050 --> 08:11.380
<b>That's enough, you damn fakes!</b>

08:12.620 --> 08:17.530
<b>What'd you say?! Who's the half-ass
here, you quack knockoffs?!</b>

08:17.530 --> 08:19.390
<b>Don't!</b>

08:19.390 --> 08:21.090
<b>Never mind, just don't.</b>

08:22.800 --> 08:27.360
<b>What in the world's going on here?
So now...</b>

08:28.600 --> 08:30.160
<b>Which are the real ones?</b>

08:35.210 --> 08:36.680
<b>What's the deal here?</b>

08:36.680 --> 08:40.920
<b>Well, see? It means we seem
more like fakes.</b>

08:40.920 --> 08:43.590
<b>We hadn't even eaten yet.</b>

08:43.590 --> 08:47.720
<b>Well, at least I don't have to do
those bothersome thngs now.</b>

08:47.720 --> 08:52.030
<b>Are you a sore loser now because
you got mistaken for the fake?!</b>

08:52.030 --> 08:53.090
<b>What did you say?</b>

08:53.090 --> 08:53.530
<b>Now, now, what does it really matter?
What did you say?</b>

08:53.530 --> 08:55.530
<b>Now, now, what does it really matter?</b>

08:55.530 --> 08:58.800
<b>For starters, we've managed
to secure beds for the night.</b>

09:00.440 --> 09:02.430
<b>Beds?</b>

09:06.740 --> 09:12.450
<b>We're truly sorry. We came
this close to being tricked.</b>

09:12.450 --> 09:15.880
<b>Mistaking such a sorry lot for Master
Sanzo and your followers...</b>

09:15.880 --> 09:17.820
<b>How can we possibly make up for this?</b>

09:18.790 --> 09:21.880
<b>We won't let the fakes get away
with this. They'll be executed!</b>

09:25.060 --> 09:27.930
<b>No, no, you need not go so far.</b>

09:27.930 --> 09:30.800
<b>Such things often happen.</b>

09:30.800 --> 09:34.570
<b>Truly Priest Sanzo, that's
so forgiving of you!</b>

09:34.570 --> 09:38.100
<b>I wish those fakes could hear you now.</b>

09:40.440 --> 09:42.180
<b>Damn it! You're such a glutton!</b>

09:42.180 --> 09:45.440
<b>We're all hungry. If we rush,
it'll blow our cover!</b>

09:46.550 --> 09:50.080
<b>But you know, can you do it soon?
We're counting on ya, okay?</b>

09:50.080 --> 09:51.720
<b>Okay, got it.</b>

09:51.720 --> 09:53.590
<b>Well, ahem...</b>

09:53.590 --> 09:59.590
<b>By the way, Chief, we've had a hard
journey this past week and...</b>

09:59.590 --> 10:02.460
<b>Oh, of course!</b>

10:02.460 --> 10:05.530
<b>We've prepared the ultimate meal
to make you feel welcome.</b>

10:05.530 --> 10:07.270
<b>Please wait just a while longer.</b>

10:07.270 --> 10:10.940
<b>Ah, well, ultimate, is it? Very good.</b>

10:10.940 --> 10:12.410
<b>That's very good.</b>

10:14.510 --> 10:18.140
<b>But still, those guys were pretty
quick-witted, you know?</b>

10:19.280 --> 10:21.910
<b>I had no idea there were
people like them.</b>

10:22.620 --> 10:26.290
<b>Hey, Sanzo, I'm hungry.</b>

10:26.290 --> 10:28.560
<b>Damn it, go eat the wall or something.</b>

10:28.560 --> 10:30.260
<b>Hey, quiet in there!</b>

10:30.260 --> 10:34.460
<b>Hey, Mister, I'm hungry.</b>

10:34.460 --> 10:37.970
<b>You're damn brazen for a criminal.</b>

10:37.970 --> 10:41.470
<b>I don't care what, just hurry up
and bring me something.</b>

10:41.470 --> 10:45.270
<b>Don't be silly! We've got nothing here
we're willing to feed to you!</b>

10:46.270 --> 10:50.140
<b>Cheapskate, then I'll go get it myself.</b>

10:50.140 --> 10:52.280
<b>Don't mess with me, you stinking brat.</b>

10:52.280 --> 10:54.770
<b>Do you even know what you're saying?</b>

10:56.280 --> 10:58.580
<b>Food... Food...</b>

11:01.260 --> 11:02.810
<b>He's a monster!</b>

11:03.990 --> 11:07.130
<b>Now, now, not so fast.</b>

11:07.130 --> 11:11.220
<b>Exactly, you must stay and properly
keep an eye on us, Mr. Guard.</b>

11:16.300 --> 11:17.770
<b>Now then...</b>

11:32.250 --> 11:35.790
<b>Hey, switch the ashtray!</b>

11:35.790 --> 11:37.620
<b>Yes, coming!</b>

11:39.730 --> 11:42.220
<b>This local sake's pretty good.</b>

11:42.460 --> 11:43.590
<b>Local Sake</b>

11:45.400 --> 11:46.630
<b>More beer!</b>

11:46.630 --> 11:46.900
<b>Yes, Sir!
More beer!</b>

11:46.900 --> 11:48.100
<b>Yes, Sir!</b>

12:04.420 --> 12:05.920
<b>What's this?!</b>

12:05.920 --> 12:09.620
<b>As you can see, it's the ultimate
vegetarian meal.</b>

12:10.560 --> 12:13.430
<b>What the hell is ultimate about this?!</b>

12:13.430 --> 12:17.260
<b>It only looks like a toy tea set to me.</b>

12:17.900 --> 12:21.500
<b>Our village is very active in
researching vegetarian dishes,</b>

12:21.500 --> 12:24.700
<b>and the result of that research
is the meal before you.</b>

12:25.270 --> 12:27.900
<b>How very fine.</b>

12:38.150 --> 12:41.760
<b>Damn it! They gave us just
that tiny bit to eat,</b>

12:41.760 --> 12:45.430
<b>and they made me lecture them
for so long!</b>

12:45.430 --> 12:47.330
<b>Don't complain, don't complain.</b>

12:47.330 --> 12:48.960
<b>Thanks to that famous guy,</b>

12:48.960 --> 12:51.670
<b>we get to enjoy some of his privileges.</b>

12:51.670 --> 12:53.670
<b>Well, that's for sure.</b>

12:53.670 --> 12:55.940
<b>But those other guys...</b>

12:55.940 --> 12:58.040
<b>They didn't look anything
like the real thing.</b>

12:58.040 --> 12:59.970
<b>Yeah! No kidding!</b>

12:59.970 --> 13:02.540
<b>They've got to be some of
the worst fakes out there.</b>

13:02.540 --> 13:04.910
<b>They had no sense of grace or dignity.</b>

13:04.910 --> 13:06.750
<b>You never know.</b>

13:06.750 --> 13:10.690
<b>They might actually turn out
to be the real thing.</b>

13:10.690 --> 13:12.150
<b>Oh, no way!</b>

13:12.990 --> 13:15.010
<b>I'm kidding!</b>

13:29.940 --> 13:32.510
<b>But still, what a sabby village.</b>

13:32.510 --> 13:35.780
<b>It'd probably be better if we left
before they catch on.</b>

13:35.780 --> 13:37.010
<b>You got that right.</b>

13:37.010 --> 13:37.280
<b>Not so fast!
You got that right.</b>

13:37.280 --> 13:38.380
<b>Not so fast!</b>

13:38.380 --> 13:40.950
<b>What? Who?</b>

13:40.950 --> 13:44.420
<b>I've got something I need you guys
to do for me.</b>

13:44.420 --> 13:46.790
<b>Who the hell are you?!</b>

13:46.790 --> 13:48.310
<b>It can't be... A demon?!</b>

13:51.330 --> 13:52.990
<b>Damn parasites.</b>

14:07.240 --> 14:08.480
<b>This is...</b>

14:08.480 --> 14:08.740
<b>Looks like it's another assassin.
This is...</b>

14:08.740 --> 14:11.340
<b>Looks like it's another assassin.</b>

14:14.080 --> 14:15.710
<b>Hey, wake up, Goku.</b>

14:17.890 --> 14:19.350
<b>Time to eat again already?</b>

14:20.090 --> 14:22.020
<b>Here it comes!</b>

14:22.020 --> 14:24.320
<b>What? You ordered out?</b>

14:29.730 --> 14:32.030
<b>Over here too! Help!</b>

14:35.800 --> 14:39.240
<b>Hey, now, what kind of joke is this?</b>

14:45.610 --> 14:48.280
<b>Looks like they're after us.</b>

14:48.280 --> 14:49.810
<b>Oh, dear.</b>

14:52.720 --> 14:54.190
<b>Don't fall asleep!</b>

14:59.090 --> 15:01.860
<b>That movement... It's not normal.</b>

15:01.860 --> 15:05.390
<b>It seems they're being manipulated
by someone.</b>

15:06.500 --> 15:08.370
<b>What a fancy welcome.</b>

15:11.040 --> 15:13.440
<b>Elder! We've got trouble!</b>

15:13.440 --> 15:17.780
<b>What is it? Such a din. I'm in the
middle of chanting scriptures.</b>

15:29.460 --> 15:31.130
<b>Hey, what're we going to do?</b>

15:31.130 --> 15:35.100
<b>Perhaps they're being manipulated,
but they're still humans.</b>

15:35.100 --> 15:37.500
<b>We should tone down our attack
appropriately, and...</b>

15:38.430 --> 15:40.000
<b>What? What's wrong?</b>

15:40.000 --> 15:42.370
<b>Goku, you stay back.</b>

15:42.370 --> 15:43.640
<b>Why?</b>

15:43.640 --> 15:43.870
<b>Because you can't tone down your
attack, now can you?
Why?</b>

15:43.870 --> 15:46.470
<b>Because you can't tone down your
attack, now can you?</b>

15:46.470 --> 15:47.210
<b>What?</b>

15:47.210 --> 15:48.010
<b>This is no time for chit chat!
What?</b>

15:48.010 --> 15:50.650
<b>This is no time for chit chat!</b>

15:50.650 --> 15:54.050
<b>You're all as good as dead!</b>

15:55.050 --> 15:56.780
<b>Nyoi-bou!</b>

16:03.660 --> 16:05.130
<b>That's...</b>

16:12.270 --> 16:15.940
<b>Master Sanzo and Master Sanzo
are fighting.</b>

16:15.940 --> 16:17.430
<b>What on Earth's going on here?!</b>

16:20.640 --> 16:22.630
<b>Hey, these guys aren't half bad.</b>

16:24.850 --> 16:27.450
<b>It seems they're being bolstered
by demonic powers,</b>

16:27.450 --> 16:30.780
<b>but on the other hand, it must be an
enormous strain on their bodies.</b>

16:31.420 --> 16:33.480
<b>If this drags out, their
bodies won't last!</b>

16:37.760 --> 16:39.750
<b>Damn, then what're we
supposed to do?</b>

16:40.700 --> 16:42.130
<b>What else?!</b>

16:43.500 --> 16:45.520
<b>Beat them up just enough
so they won't die!</b>

16:48.540 --> 16:50.000
<b>You got that right.</b>

16:59.680 --> 17:01.150
<b>Things are okay over here too.</b>

17:06.590 --> 17:07.890
<b>All that remains is...</b>

17:07.890 --> 17:08.090
<b>Four down!
All that remains is...</b>

17:08.090 --> 17:09.490
<b>Four down!</b>

17:09.490 --> 17:11.330
<b>That was good exercise.</b>

17:11.330 --> 17:13.450
<b>Let us leave the rest up to Sanzo.</b>

17:21.740 --> 17:24.940
<b>Good grief, they didn't last very long.</b>

17:24.940 --> 17:28.480
<b>Well, I didn't really care
which side died.</b>

17:28.480 --> 17:30.710
<b>Because they're both enemies
anyway, right?</b>

17:30.710 --> 17:35.550
<b>Yeah, it makes it easier for me
to have them kill each other.</b>

17:35.550 --> 17:37.050
<b>Who the hell?!</b>

17:37.050 --> 17:40.220
<b>Sanzo?! How did you find me?!</b>

17:40.220 --> 17:41.960
<b>What are you, a moron?</b>

17:41.960 --> 17:45.230
<b>You were using your powers
to manipulate those humans.</b>

17:45.230 --> 17:47.520
<b>I could smell your demonic aura
a mile away.</b>

17:48.800 --> 17:53.320
<b>Very good, Sanzo, but can
you dodge this attack?!</b>

17:56.340 --> 17:59.070
<b>Ooh, Sanzo's getting showy up there!</b>

17:59.070 --> 18:00.540
<b>Good luck!</b>

18:01.140 --> 18:02.610
<b>A moron after all.</b>

18:03.510 --> 18:05.480
<b>How dare you?!</b>

18:06.080 --> 18:07.880
<b>Sanzo, your life is mine!</b>

18:11.320 --> 18:13.550
<b>Damn it! Hit! Hit him!</b>

18:23.130 --> 18:25.530
<b>Makai Tenjou!</b>

18:31.010 --> 18:32.510
<b>Oh, that's...</b>

18:32.510 --> 18:37.950
<b>Oh, that's truly just as the\ancient legend says.</b>

18:37.950 --> 18:39.780
<b>Then, that person is...</b>

18:39.780 --> 18:45.450
<b>Yes, that man's the real Priest Sanzo!</b>

18:57.330 --> 19:00.500
<b>I ache all over for some reason.</b>

19:00.500 --> 19:02.090
<b>Man, that was hell.</b>

19:03.840 --> 19:05.330
<b>My head hurts.</b>

19:08.210 --> 19:11.750
<b>So you're finally up, you fake bastards!</b>

19:11.750 --> 19:14.850
<b>But they sure aren't anything like us.</b>

19:14.850 --> 19:19.750
<b>It's dangerous, so I advise you
stop pretending to be us.</b>

19:20.420 --> 19:21.850
<b>Hey, you guys.</b>

19:22.460 --> 19:25.360
<b>Yes, Sir! What is it?</b>

19:25.360 --> 19:27.930
<b>Hurry up and get out of my sight.</b>

19:27.930 --> 19:29.730
<b>Yes, Sir!</b>

19:31.170 --> 19:31.500
<b>Wait for me!</b>

19:31.500 --> 19:32.670
<b>Don't leave me behind!
Wait for me!</b>

19:32.670 --> 19:33.030
<b>This village has been saved by
Master Sanzo once again.</b>

19:33.030 --> 19:36.970
<b>This village has been saved by
Master Sanzo once again.</b>

19:38.140 --> 19:41.840
<b>It's not like we went out of
our way to save you.</b>

19:41.840 --> 19:45.380
<b>We just fought for ourselves.</b>

19:45.380 --> 19:48.880
<b>Even so, you're worthy
of our admiration.</b>

19:48.880 --> 19:54.220
<b>After all, you must have worked
quite hard to gain such powers.</b>

19:54.220 --> 19:55.690
<b>Are you kidding me?!</b>

19:57.090 --> 19:59.490
<b>I hate hard work more than
anything in the world.</b>

20:00.560 --> 20:02.800
<b>Damn it! We'll remember this!</b>

20:02.800 --> 20:05.730
<b>Those bastards made fools out of us!</b>

20:05.780 --> 21:00.150
<b>Looking good-natured, without
cause for suspicion</b>

20:06.500 --> 20:07.870
<b>Who the hell are you guys?</b>

20:09.800 --> 20:11.740
<b>And who the hell are you?</b>

20:11.740 --> 20:16.110
<b>Don't be ridiculous! This man here
is the great Master Genjo Sanzo!</b>

20:16.110 --> 20:18.310
<b>And I'm Goku!</b>

20:18.310 --> 20:22.980
<b>I'm Hakkai! I'll have you know
we're really strong!</b>

20:23.620 --> 20:26.180
<b>Really? You're the Sanzo Party?</b>

20:28.220 --> 20:30.090
<b>What a waste of time.</b>

20:32.730 --> 20:35.360
<b>Let's not dress like this anymore.</b>

20:35.360 --> 20:37.260
<b>I agree...</b>

20:41.840 --> 20:44.100
<b>Nothing good happens to us.</b>

20:44.100 --> 20:45.570
<b>No kidding.</b>

20:48.380 --> 20:54.780
<b>That's right, even sudden
tragedies come</b>

21:00.150 --> 21:05.660
<b>Don't complain, just shut up</b>

21:05.660 --> 21:09.030
<b>And look up</b>

21:09.030 --> 21:14.870
<b>I'll stay in character no matter
how ordinary the scene is</b>

21:14.870 --> 21:20.270
<b>Before any talk of dreams or hopes</b>

21:20.270 --> 21:25.580
<b>It's probably the same for everyone</b>

21:25.580 --> 21:29.540
<b>You must fight against yourself</b>

21:36.520 --> 21:40.190
<b>The sun sets and a new day comes</b>

21:40.190 --> 21:42.160
<b>Repeating is one change</b>

21:42.160 --> 21:46.270
<b>Don't avert eyes from differences</b>

21:46.270 --> 21:50.400
<b>Your nerve and soul to the limit</b>

21:50.400 --> 21:53.070
<b>Go forward now</b>

21:53.070 --> 21:58.110
<b>Standing next to the taut pressure</b>

21:58.110 --> 22:03.550
<b>I'll laugh more boldly and
fearlessly than anyone</b>

22:03.550 --> 22:08.960
<b>It's probably the same for everyone</b>

22:08.960 --> 22:13.020
<b>You must fight against yourself</b>

22:22.970 --> 22:24.370
<b>Next Saiyuki</b>

22:25.740 --> 22:28.810
<b>The creepy mechanical doll that
appeared out of the darkness</b>

22:28.810 --> 22:31.780
<b>fired a beam, and Gojyo got hit!</b>

22:31.780 --> 22:36.680
<b>What the hell's this?! Something's
moving around inside Gojyo's body!</b>

22:36.680 --> 22:39.050
<b>What? Sanzo, what're you doing?</b>

22:39.050 --> 22:40.520
<b>If you do that, Gojyo will...</b>

22:41.620 --> 22:43.420
<b>Next time on Gensou Maden Saiyuki:
"The Laughing Grim Reaper"</b>

22:43.420 --> 22:46.060
<b>Next Time
The Laughing Grim Reaper
Next time on Gensou Maden Saiyuki:
"The Laughing Grim Reaper"</b>

22:46.060 --> 22:47.360
<b>Next Time
